# Conformance probe pack for the field option `null` (spec 0.56) on `json`,
# for a nested member. Public. No kinds. Added because none of the 0.56 probe
# packs maps a member inside a nested object: `a.b` with `null` pins the
# sentence that a nested object holding only `null` members is written, where
# Version 0.5 leaves out a nested object with no members.
format  conformance-null-056-1
version 0.56.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    json
field   uid      id   string
field   probe.a  a.b  float  null
